eally matter that it only has one number type. Since we are parsing it into our own representation.\r\nBut I can add the rest of the note.","created_at":"2026-01-30T16:58:57Z","updated_at":"2026-01-30T17:06:57Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114872#discussion_r2747166462","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114872","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2747166462"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114872#discussion_r2747166462"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114872"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2747166462/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":34,"original_line":34,"side":"LEFT","in_reply_to_id":2747102483,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":4,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2747895790","pull_request_review_id":3730298625,"id":2747895790,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc6jyY_u","diff_hunk":"@@ -31,7 +31,6 @@\n \t\t[b]Note:[/b] Both parse methods do not fully comply with the JSON specification:\n \t\t- Trailing commas in arrays or objects are ignored, instead of causing a parser error.\n \t\t- New line and tab characters are accepted in string literals, and are treated like their corresponding escape sequences [code]\\n[/code] and [code]\\t[/code].\n-\t\t- Numbers are parsed using [method String.to_float] which is generally more lax than the JSON specification.","path":"doc/classes/JSON.xml","commit_id":"507df6996a7dcd0c0c9135d70762c47b3fe33339","original_commit_id":"a9b67c6e8d088bcde7d9dce336fb0995b8d3d4f8","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githu